@startuml
!include style.iuml
' UC-08 Create and Configure Exam (M8). Built from activity_config and the teacher part of activity_applications.
' Code: Admin_Web_Panel pages/teacher/CreateExamPage.tsx (four-step wizard, AllowedAppsPicker);
' ExamsController CreateExam / UpdateExam / ValidateExamPayloadAsync / RefuseOtherTeachersStudentsAsync;
' audit EXAM_CREATED / EXAM_UPDATED in the same save. Lockdown mode default Report.
' Announcement: pages/notifications/AnnouncementPage.tsx ("Also send via email"); NotificationsController
' AnnounceToExam (owner or admin only, eligible students only, refused if none) -> NotificationService.SendToManyAsync
' (in-app notification, EmailService SMTP when SendEmail).
' Plain labels: routes, status codes and the full validation list are left out.
' Large font at dpi 96. Printed pt = fontSize * printed_width_pt / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 25
}

|Teacher (Web Panel)|
|Server|
|Teacher (Web Panel)|
start
:Open the exam
wizard (new exam
or edit);
:1. Basic info: title,
section, date, time,
duration;
:2. Questions: MCQ,
theory, coding with
test cases;
:3. Rules: allowed apps,
lockdown mode, webcam,
readiness, seat;
:4. Assign
students;
(A)
:Save the
exam;
|Server|
if (Edit: exam exists,
own section, still
Scheduled?) then ([no])
  :Refuse with
  the reason;
  |Teacher (Web Panel)|
  stop
else ([yes or new])
endif
|Server|
if (Section, questions,
marks and test cases valid,
students in own sections
(teacher)?) then ([no])
  |Teacher (Web Panel)|
  :Show the error,
  fix the step;
  (A)
  detach
else ([yes])
  |Server|
  :Save the exam, its
  questions and students,
  log it in the audit log;
endif
|Teacher (Web Panel)|
:Back to the
dashboard;
if (Announce
the exam?) then ([yes])
  :Pick the exam, write title
  and message, tick "also
  send via email", send;
  |Server|
  :Own exam with eligible
  students? Notify each one,
  also by email if ticked;
  |Teacher (Web Panel)|
  :See "sent to N
  students" or error;
else ([no])
endif
stop
@enduml
